05231872_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KjdmF3A4D6IQ7kNvwFYOf82&_nc_oc=Adnq4wCR9myoTVu-4l8Sg719_xkt4g7aRKiuJ-5Vs785BQ7nEx59K7z-5P9M6jhMN6Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvX1mNV_HTc4wXA4uo1adZnA-sypGLC7li6cxYd7iGuQQ&oe=699EE5CE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TRAILER COVER.png", "id": "459143080084620", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982658_459143083417953_4317925573810879115_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=69dQ_jSJhUkQ7kNvwFDSGLH&_nc_oc=AdnDwq3EFhPtY0u5yNcKr3kK4Tt9dT67Lzxtxn8tceJ-M8Jwy_Aytt2Z07dFEWkvHfY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv6U1MkqM4QTAjEr-JXFIZdigZ-WYez-FSoO0160OSsnw&oe=699ED89A"}, "display_name": "Lifestory - App", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Lifestory: Explore Your Timelines in VR**\n\nStep into the Timeline Room and immerse yourself in the world of your memories with Lifestory. Experience your life's most precious moments in a virtual reality museum.\n\n**Features:**\n- **Timeline Room:** Navigate through a beautifully designed VR space where all your timelines are displayed. \n- **View Moments:** Relive your photos, and writings in an immersive environment. Each timeline is a gallery of your life's unique moments.\n- **VR Museum:** See your life\u2019s story unfold in a virtual reality museum. Every moment is a piece of art, brought to life in VR.\n\nBecause every moment of life is unique, Lifestory lets you etch them forever on secure timelines and experience them in a whole new way.", "short_description": "Step into the Timeline Room and immerse yourself in your life's moments with Lifestory on Meta Quest. Navigate through a virtual reality museum where your timelines and memories come to life."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://api.lifestoryapp.com/static/html/terms.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Lifestory", "support_websi